~ start
if QuestManager.talked_to_team["Spero"] == true:
	Spero: ...
	=> END
astryn: Spero.
spero: Yo, Ass. How’s it going?
astryn: Told you to stop calling me that, meathead.
spero: Grow a pair, the old man don’t mind a nickname.
astryn: Well, I ain’t Aeg, and chill on him too.
spero: Fine, fine. What’s up?
astryn: Learn anything?
spero: About what?
astryn: The duel, dumbass! Jesus, we should’ve left your ass in Haustoria.
spero: Ohhh, my fault, hothead. Yeah, I’ve got some stuff.
astryn: Spill.
spero: Chopped it up with some of the guards, they told m-
astryn: You did what now! Are you insane?!
spero: Chillll, trust.
astryn: ...
spero: They told me some good stuff. The morals in this place are cooked—they’ll do anything for coin. They said the big man has actually gone demon form before.
astryn: What now?!
spero: Damn, slow down. Apparently, when someone tried to stage a coup a year back, a few of them saw him transform for a split second. Absolute bloodbath. Dude finished the guy off instantly.
astryn: Shit, that spins things up.
spero: Yeah, I ain’t seen one yet.
astryn: Novius and I ran into one before, tough fight… but it’ll be fine. Anything else that coin got us?
spero: Shit… some drinks down my hatch.
astryn: ... see ya later, brick brains.
spero: Oh, so you can use nickn—
do QuestManager.mark_as_talked_to("Spero")
=> END